s is the icon code I worked on at the last.  The fix was to give better
return messages when variables were set.  If only one variable is set
the variable and what it is set to is printed out via a send_debug
print statement.  The statment will look like "Variable # i set to n".

If an array of fariables is set the message will be
Variables i - i+n set.
 
Files involved in this change are:
common/var_sr.c
icon/inst_setvars.c

These files still exist on lemming because Peter was working on them.
In order to make them there needs to be an include directory, with a number of 
include files in it, one level above this one.
